From 2c5ec20c69cadcce7d86f5e8e8a62189c83a7a21 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: misc-de <misc-de@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 17:53:30 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] plugins: USB quick setting

Plinius: what an attached computer gets over USB, through plinius-usb
(org.plinius.Usb on the system bus): File Sharing (MTP), USB Network
(NCM) and Internet for the Computer (NAT through the phone). The tile
only shows while a computer is attached; nothing is on unless chosen,
which is charging only. The status page has a switch per function, a tap
on the active tile goes back to charging only.

Functions only go on while the phone is unlocked (the service checks it
as well), switching off always works.
